t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-02b8d30 elementor-widget-divider--view-line elementor-widget elementor-widget-divider\" data-id=\"02b8d30\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"divider.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-divider\">\n\t\t\t<span class=\"elementor-divider-separator\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/span>\n\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-aaac781 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"aaac781\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>We design tailored content experiences that combine learning and entertainment. Whether it\u2019s a mobile escape room, a custom pub quiz, or a creative writing workshop, our programs deliver knowledge in a way that is engaging, memorable, and impactful for everyone.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e7d5f19 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-parent\" data-id=\"e7d5f19\" data-element_type=\"container\" data-e-type=\"container\" id=\"a02\" data-settings=\"{&quot;background_background&quot;:&quot;classic&quot;}\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-6416123 elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"6416123\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"800\" height=\"800\" src=\"https:\/\/mindtrails.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/11\/Icons-04.svg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-288\" alt=\"\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-9a87d08 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget-mobile__width-inherit elementor-widget elementor-widget-heading\" data-id=\"9a87d08\" data-elemen